  "description": "Run, don’t walk, stocks are cheaper NOW 🛒",
  "body_html": "<p>Did you have a little FOMO coming into this article? </p><p>Stop. Breathe. </p><p>Do not become victim to what is known as “<strong>anchoring bias”</strong>… the belief that because a stock was once at a high price, it MUST go back to that price again. This is simply, false. </p><p>I was once a dip buyer too. Then I decided I wanted to make money. A better phrase than “buy the dip” is: <strong>“Buy high, sell higher.”</strong> Following this simple saying will get you into far more winning positions than not. </p><p>The <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener</a> </strong>(updated daily) gave signals for many of these popular stocks: Bloom Energy, Palantir, Rigetti (and many others) last year…<em><strong>NOT TODAY</strong></em>. We go after stocks in uptrends, with consolidation breakouts and early institutional volume moving in. We ride already developed trends.</p><p>Not saying these stocks can’t go back up…but as of right now, trend is down, and odds are against you. </p><p>Ok, rant over. That all said…</p><p>Overall market is looking pretty decent. I don’t like to put too many predictions out on Monday, as I am seeing how the market is deciding to absorb whatever catastrophic news that came out over the weekend. I am mostly seeing a lot of risk on assets and tech stocks make a recovery. I have been expecting this, as I mentioned last week that Finance stocks were charging upwards, which often leads other sectors in the weeks following. </p><p>The new <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-etf-20?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF 2.0</a> is gradually pulling away from the S&amp;P 500, while the original is maintaining its lead. So these are good signs. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qYXY!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qYXY!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qYXY!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qYXY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qYXY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qYXY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png\" width=\"803\" height=\"402\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:402,&quot;width&quot;:803,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:78949,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/209634991?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qYXY!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qYXY!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qYXY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qYXY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa0e8e4c0-0f9b-418a-b1a8-fac89b20776d_803x402.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I am expecting to do mid-week movers this week…we are mostly confirming that we do in fact have bullish trends developing, instead of a potential dead cat bounce last week. Remember, you do not need to be first to buy, just need to catch a piece of trend, should it exist. </p><p>As always, I will keep you updated. If you have questions, feel free to stop by the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/f0cce345-4d01-43b4-87c8-60102042ebb8\">Main Chat</a> during market hours. </p><p>Thanks for stopping by! </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>",
